      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»elephant 2.0« – 操作简单",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>01. 选择<strong>刀具类型</strong>，例如：立铣刀 &gt; 带倒角的立铣刀</p> <p>02. 选择所需<strong>参数</strong></p> <p>03. 执行<strong>测量</strong>，例如有效轮廓圆角</p> <p>04.<strong> 测量结果</strong>（全自动测量，无需数据输入/编程）</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/e/csm_software_elephant_02_cbba3e75f8.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 556
